  m_text: "<size=21>\n- During Base Games or Free Games after a spin, Extra Wild symbols
    randomly appear on the reels.\n\n- When additional Wild symbol overlaps with already
    existing Wild symbol on a spot, then that Wild symbol upgrades to 2x Wild. \n\n-
    All reels reset to their standard layout every spin.\n</size>"
