      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=21>

    - 3 Scatter symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers Wheel Bonus during Base Games.


    - You can collect Credits or Wilds for Free Games.


    - You can win Grand or Mega Jackpot when playing at qualifying bets.


    - When the bet is not qualified for Jackpots, Grand Jackpot awards 300x Base Bet
    and Mega Jackpot awards 100x Base Bet.


    - You can win Grand or Mega Jackpot multiple times during Wheel Bonus. Only first
    claimed Jackpot awards Jackpot Progressive. Afterwards, Grand Jackpot awards  300x
    Base Bet and Mega Jackpot awards 100x Base Bet.


    - Wheel Bonus ends when winning Free Games.

    </size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
