      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=21>

    - Gold Scatter only appears on reel 5 during Free Games.


    - Up to 5 Gold Scatters can appear during Free Games.


    - 2 Scatter symbols and one Gold Scatter symbol re-triggers 8 Free Games, adding
    20 Wilds to the reels.


    - Gold Scatter on reel 5 that does not re-trigger Free Games adds only 10 Wilds
    to the reels next spin.


    - Claimed Gold Scatter turns into normal Scatter for the remaining Free Games.

    </size>'
